==Battleground==
*1 [[Inumusha]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*25 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Corporal Weyland]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 65.33~68.67 seconds<sup>1,960f~2,060f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the buffs on the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], it is recommended to have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from all three chapters of [[Cats of the Cosmos]].

The [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] aren't that bad thanks to the UltraBaaBaas, as [[Wave Attack]]s can easily get around and stun-lock Inumusha, whereas the other Zombies are all low-ranged pushers that can act as additional stepping stones. Still, it would be advisable to eliminate them quickly through whatever means necessary. Save your [[Cat Cannon]] for when the Dread Bores spawn, as it can be used to interrupt their burrowing and prevent them from becoming a problem.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]: Effortlessly tanks hits from the Zombies when aided by Research [[Cat Combo]]s. Can also be given Warp Immunity through [[Talents]] to make the Weylands even less of an issue.
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]: Cheap and strong backup unit that can swiftly kill any Zombies that make it past the frontlines.

==Trivia==
*Floor 43 being the first and only [[Heavenly Tower]] floor to have [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] may be a reference to how the 43rd [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapter, [[Area 22]], is the first sub-chapter to have Starred Aliens.
*Prior to the [[Version 9.10 Update]], there was one extra Corporal Weyland and most of the enemies spawned slightly earlier:
**The 25 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s used to have a delay of 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>, instead of 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**The 1 [[Dread Bore]] at 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup> used to spawn at 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**The 2 [[Corporal Weyland]]s at 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup> used to spawn at 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, and their current delay of 65.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,960f~2,060f</sup> used to be a delay of 52~58.67 seconds<sup>1,560f~1,760f</sup>. Their number was also increased by 1, making 3 Corporal Weylands instead of 2.
**The 1 [[Zang Roo]] at 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup> used to spawn at 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**The 1 [[Dread Bore]] at 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup> used to spawn at 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>.

